{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Widlands Dominion",
    "steam_appid": 3523030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/4d59ad014c7cc91721ff6d91ef68d24d.avif?t=1749067565\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fights unfold on a grid-based battlefield filled with unpredictable tile effects. Adapt your strategy, position your units carefully, and guide your team through deadly encounters. The fate of the Widlands depends on your command. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/d62fe1ef90c5b027fbedf3b9d67d689e.poster.avif?t=1749067565\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/d62fe1ef90c5b027fbedf3b9d67d689e.webm?t=1749067565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/d62fe1ef90c5b027fbedf3b9d67d689e.mp4?t=1749067565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your warrior band by recruiting heroes from distinct classes, each with their own unique skills and combat roles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes through battle, upgrade their stats, and choose from a wide range of powerful perks to shape your strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath. All warriors who fall in battle stay dead every fight carries real consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your path through the Widlands in a roguelike structure with branching routes, randomized encounters, and increasing danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across dynamic environments where certain tiles trigger traps, curses, forced movement, or other effects that can shift the tide of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a diverse enemy roster, each with unique equipment, abilities, and perks that challenge your tactical thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter different final bosses at the end of each run each presenting a unique threat and requiring a different approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend earned reputation and gold points between runs to unlock stronger warriors and expand your options for future expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mature Content Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game revolves around killing enemies on grid-based battlefields. This results in a mild gore such as blood splatters or blood pools, but gore certainly isn't focus of the game.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/4d59ad014c7cc91721ff6d91ef68d24d.avif?t=1749067565\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fights unfold on a grid-based battlefield filled with unpredictable tile effects. Adapt your strategy, position your units carefully, and guide your team through deadly encounters. The fate of the Widlands depends on your command. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/d62fe1ef90c5b027fbedf3b9d67d689e.poster.avif?t=1749067565\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/d62fe1ef90c5b027fbedf3b9d67d689e.webm?t=1749067565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/d62fe1ef90c5b027fbedf3b9d67d689e.mp4?t=1749067565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your warrior band by recruiting heroes from distinct classes, each with their own unique skills and combat roles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes through battle, upgrade their stats, and choose from a wide range of powerful perks to shape your strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath. All warriors who fall in battle stay dead every fight carries real consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your path through the Widlands in a roguelike structure with branching routes, randomized encounters, and increasing danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across dynamic environments where certain tiles trigger traps, curses, forced movement, or other effects that can shift the tide of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a diverse enemy roster, each with unique equipment, abilities, and perks that challenge your tactical thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter different final bosses at the end of each run each presenting a unique threat and requiring a different approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend earned reputation and gold points between runs to unlock stronger warriors and expand your options for future expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mature Content Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game revolves around killing enemies on grid-based battlefields. This results in a mild gore such as blood splatters or blood pools, but gore certainly isn't focus of the game.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Widlands Dominion is a turn-based tactical RPG where every choice shapes your survival. Build a team of warriors, each with unique classes and skills, and venture into treacherous dungeons. Adapt your strategy, overcome deadly foes, and put an end to the dark force threatening Widlands.",
